cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use safha in research, please cite it as below."
title: "safha: lossless crop, deskew and split for scanned book PDFs"
abstract: >-
  A tool that crops, levels and splits scanned book PDFs without re-encoding their page images: one box size per book
  placed on each page's text, deskew by drawing matrices accepted only when independent measures agree, and pages whose
  lines lie at two angles left as scanned.
authors:
